    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "R1 Learning vs Servimatt"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "R1 Learning Highlights"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Salary**: $120k-$150k (25-56% higher than Servimatt)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Stack**: Laravel + Vue.js (full-stack)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Location**: San Diego (mostly remote, 3-4x/month in-person)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Mission**: Behavioral health/education tech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Role**: Direct work with leadership, potential to grow into leadership"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Stage**: Fast-growing SaaS"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Key Differences"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Factor | Servimatt | R1 Learning |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| --- | --- | --- |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Salary** | $96k | $120k-$150k |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Focus** | Frontend (AI integration) | Full-stack |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Remote** | 100% remote | Mostly remote (some SD visits) |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Stage** | Established | Fast-growing startup |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Tech** | React/Angular + AI APIs | Laravel + Vue.js |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "About Doing Both..."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Not recommended** for these reasons:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Contractual Issues**: Both likely have exclusivity clauses or require full-time commitment"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Time Conflict**: Both expect 9-5 availability and regular meetings"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Ethical Concerns**: Could damage your reputation if discovered"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Burnout Risk**: 80 hours/week is unsustainable"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Legal Risk**: Could be grounds for immediate termination at both companies"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Better Strategy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Option 1: Wait for R1 Learning**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-28",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Tell Servimatt you need until next week (you're within the 7-day window)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-29",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Complete R1 interview process"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Make informed decision with both offers in hand"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Option 2: Accept Servimatt, Continue R1 Process**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-33",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Accept Servimatt (start date Nov 17)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-34",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Continue R1 interviews"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-35",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If R1 makes better offer, decline Servimatt before start date"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-36",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "⚠️ Risk: Burns bridge with Servimatt"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Option 3: Negotiate with Servimatt**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-39",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Use R1 salary range as leverage"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-40",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Ask for $120k+ to match market rate"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-41",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "See if they can improve the offer"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "My Recommendation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Wait for R1 Learning** - Here's why:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-45",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Salary difference is significant ($24k-$54k/year)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-46",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Full-stack role may offer more growth"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-47",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Mission-driven work in behavioral health"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-48",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Direct leadership exposure"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-49",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "You're clearly excited about it"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You have time. Servimatt gave you 7 days, and you can reasonably take until early next week. R1's interview process will likely move quickly given they're actively hiring."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Draft response to Servimatt** (buying more time):"
